on":null,"draft":true,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122393","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122393","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122393.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122393.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThe UI hasn't been updated (well, not much) since the \"GODOT IS OPEN SOURCE\" commit, so I decided to give it some love:\r\n\r\n- Changed the \"..\" button to \"Browse\" (the accessibility name) and added an icon to it\r\n- Changed the default path to an empty string (bugfix, results in proper error messages)\r\n- Changed some `SpinBoxes`/`HSliders` into `EditorSpinSliders`\r\n- Grouped the random controls into a single section called \"Randomization\"\r\n- Set the \"Amount\" default arrow step to `5`\r\n- Changed the default window width\r\n- Multiply window size by editor scale (bugfix)\r\n- Removed the ability to vertically resize the window\r\n- Take the absolute value of scale in `_populate`, to prevent negative scales (only behavioral change in this PR)\r\n\r\nThis makes it look slightly prettier and feel better to use.\r\n\r\n| Before | After |\r\n|--------|--------|\r\n| <img width=\"269\" height=\"620\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/874580ff-2e22-4ff8-9205-38550fdfc4f8\" /> | <img width=\"331\" height=\"573\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f9142d7f-656b-45e5-b863-9fa629c4db6a\" /> |\r\n\r\n## Discussion\r\n\r\nI don't like the ± in the random section, but I couldn't find anything better.\r\n\r\nThe scale sliders have an upper limit for the slider, which has to be small to allow low values. I tried using `set_exp_ratio`, but that works exactly opposite of how I want it for values below `1.0`. Is there a workaround for that?\r\n\r\n## Additional info\r\n\r\nThe disabling of verical resizing is quite hacky, I'll remove it if it's not good enough.\r\nFeel free to comment on even the smallest of nitpicks.\r\n\r\nNo AI was used. (AI can´t see)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122393/reactions","total_count":12,"+1":8,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":3,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122393/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}